      "id": "F01",
      "finding": "Chemthrower的IAdvancedFluidItem.getFluid实际经FluidUtils取capability，并SIMULATE drain MAX_INT；IEItemFluidHandler继承Forge drain，未覆写。Forge复制流体返回，只有EXECUTE才shrink并写回或移除Fluid键。",
